    "updated_at": "2022-06-09T08:23:55Z",
    "body": "Do browsers ever send a header in that format?\r\n\r\nMy intent was to be cautious, and only allow stuff browsers already send. If browsers already send this, or a browser wants to start sending this (and folks are confident it's safe to do so), then it makes sense to update the spec.",
