    "created_at": "2022-10-12T14:27:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-12T14:27:45Z",
    "body": "I think we ended up inadvertently allowing this as part of #1454.\r\n\r\nAlthough really the existing text was buggy and didn't handle _rangeStart_ being the empty string.\r\n\r\nI guess we should explicitly disallow it and add a test for it, at least when it comes to \"`cors`\". That would result in it requiring a preflight, which seems reasonable.",
